and that’s embarrassing.

00:00:12.625 --> 00:00:13.920
Well, fear not.

00:00:15.569 --> 00:00:16.200
Dunno.

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:20.085
Here at
Reputational Damage Specialists

00:00:20.095 --> 00:00:23.030
